**Position:**  

Software Engineer (Full\-time)



**Location:**  

Hayward, CA



**Salary:**  

$161,637/year



**Job Description:**  

Predicine, Inc. in Hayward, CA seeks Software Engineer. Design, develop, and enhance LIMS and backend software to automate laboratory data workflows and support informatics and lab operations.



**Job Responsibilities:**  

Design, develop, and improve Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) and bioinformatics software to automate laboratory data entry and reporting;



Build backend services and RESTful APIs using FastAPI and Flask to connect frontend applications, databases, and data analysis pipelines;



Develop and maintain full\-stack web applications using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, React, and Flask to support laboratory operations;



Connect backend services to databases to store, retrieve, and manage laboratory and biological data;



Analyze data and create dashboards and reports to help scientists and lab staff monitor metrics and results;



Improve system performance by updating legacy services, speeding up APIs, and reducing manual work;



Set up logging, monitoring, and troubleshooting to track system performance and fix software issues; and



Work with lab staff, data analysts, and engineers to gather requirements and ensure software meets workflow and regulatory needs.



**Requirements:**  

This position requires Master’s degree or foreign equivalent in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or a related field.



No prior work experience is required, but must demonstrate knowledge and skills through academic coursework, research project, teaching assistantship, or practical training through internship or co\-op in each of the following:



HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, Flask, FastAPI and React;

Algorithm design and analysis;

Database systems, data modeling, and data analysis/visualization; and

Full\-stack web development.



**Contact:** Email resume to talentacquistion@predicine.com or mail it to 3555 Arden Road, Hayward, CA 94545\.



